PHP checks to see if secret that the user enters matches a stored secret after it has been base64_encoded, strrev, and
bin2hex.  So, we can go to an on-line PHP debugger/sandbox and execute the following.

$encodedSecret = "3d3d516343746d4d6d6c315669563362";
$output = base64_decode(strrev(hex2bin($encodedSecret)));
echo $output;

Note that if the PHP sandbox is unable to do the base64_decode, you will need to find an on-line base64 decoder to
do the last step.

